lib/libotelexport generates upb code and reflection definitions from the
common, resource, logs, metrics, trace and collector service definitions
at build time (lib/protobuf/protoc-gen.mk) for its OTLP/HTTP protobuf and
OTLP/gRPC transports.  Installed licence:
/usr/share/licenses/opentelemetry-proto.
